# Nonlinear MRI production run behind Fig. 4 of COMPHY-D-26-00110.
#
# Tracked: the run definition, the job script, the stdout log and this README.
# Untracked but present in the directory (Dropbox-backed): rms.dat, cfl.dat,
# the NetCDF diagnostics output, the final out2d/ snapshot and the figures
# generated from them.  This follows tests/MHD_INCOMP(MRI)/.gitignore -- the
# output is reproducible from the input, and gallope.out.nc alone is larger
# than everything the repository tracks for this run.
#
# Deliberately not copied from Miyabi at all: restart/ (3.1 GB),
# gallope.modes.out (2.1 GB), and all but the last snapshot of out2d/ (10 GB
# there, 48 MB here -- see README.md).
*
!*/
__pycache__/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.in
!job.pbs-*
!out.std
